hared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"yL9j5ASNic_DaDKf9lwMhw","review_id":"st9zdC8gro3AMYxbG8yyzQ","date":"2021-07-26T04:21:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9532179832458496,"text_excerpt":"Another staple in NOLA is Stein's Market and Deli. The market looks rough, there is no parking lot, it's a retail location, so you can't drink any of their large selection of cold beer inside, and every time I go there, which is as often as possible, there will be a line. Because the food is that good. I am always surprised the line moves as fast as it does. That's because the cashiers and the sandwich artists* really HUSTLE. Also, limited seating inside means you will be sharing a table with (gasp) strangers. Relax, smile and enjoy, you are all here for the same thing ... the best darn deli sandwiches in NOLA. Today, I reveled in a Hot Pastrami and Cole Slaw on Marbled Rye, with a dill p..."},{"business_id":"yL9j5ASNic_DaDKf9lwMhw","review_id":"dj0WS3OnE6OHc9Fbw0jQEA","date":"2016-05-22T14:24:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9522421956062317,"text_excerpt":"I love bagels. I'm originally from the northeast where people would give their right arms for a delicious bagel, pizza, or (in my town) pierogies. I was hesitant to try a southern bagel shop at first but when our previous lunch plans fell through, we gave it a shot. The atmosphere of Stein's is super laid back. Big communal tables, the menu written on the wall...things that I like to see in a deli-type atmosphere. I ordered an everything bagel (my absolute fave) and chive cream cheese. It was all I could've asked for in that moment. So good. The boyfriend got The Dan sandwich and also thoroughly enjoyed. I will definitely return when my bagel cravings return. I'm also looking forward to t..."},{"business_id":"yL9j5ASNic_DaDKf9lwMhw","review_id":"VF94a177G-mdBo4qEmb01Q","date":"2013-01-02T02:23:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9521687626838684,"text_excerpt":"I've been wanting to check this place out forever, because if there are two things I love, it's beer and reuben sandwiches. This place has both. I was really impressed with their beer selection, and had I been in my car I would have definitely picked up a few bottles of hard to find stuff. From what I understand it's the best beer shop in the city. After I finished admiring their amazing beer selection I ordered a reuben. And it was a damn good reuben. The best reuben I've yet had to be exact. There are some other sandwiches on the menu that caught my eye too. Can't wait to come back to give them a try. If you are looking for a deli or a place to buy beer in NOLA, you can't go wrong with ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yL9j5ASNic_DaDKf9lwMhw","photo_id":"gwaUlWJIOPXRxmYG_zWr5g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/gwaUlWJIOPXRxmYG_zWr5g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.936044454574585},{"business_id":"yL9j5ASNic_DaDKf9lwMhw","photo_id":"iHuDSV0kX0TMgadaLFRaEQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/iHuDSV0kX0TMgadaLFRaEQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9296102523803711},{"business_id":"yL9j5ASNic_DaDKf9lwMhw","photo_id":"rT442eFXxSveO3wBKBQy7g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/rT442eFXxSveO3wBKBQy7g.jpg","visual_representativeness